---

<section class="privacy" id="privacy">
  <div class="privacy-glow-left"></div>
  <div class="privacy-glow-right"></div>
  <div class="container privacy-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined privacy-shield">shield_lock</span>
      <h2 data-i18n="priv.h2">Zero Cloud. Zero Tracking.<br/>Zero Compromise.</h2>
      <p class="privacy-sub" data-i18n="priv.desc">
        We believe your mental health data is the most sensitive information you own.
        That's why TheraNode operates fundamentally differently from other wellness apps.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="privacy-cards">
      <div class="privacy-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">wifi_off</span>
        <h4 data-i18n="priv.card1.title">No Internet Required</h4>
        <p data-i18n="priv.card1.desc">The app functions perfectly offline. Your data never transmits anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">person_off</span>
        <h4 data-i18n="priv.card2.title">No Accounts</h4>
        <p data-i18n="priv.card2.desc">Skip the sign-up. There is no central database linking you to your logs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="privacy-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">block</span>
        <h4 data-i18n="priv.card3.title">No Analytics</h4>
        <p data-i18n="priv.card3.desc">We don't use third-party trackers to monitor how you use the app.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy {
    position: relative;
    padding: 100px 0;
    background: var(--sage-800);
    color: #fff;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .privacy-glow-left, .privacy-glow-right {
    position: absolute;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(120px);
    opacity: 0.15;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .privacy-glow-left { top: -100px; left: -100px; background: var(--primary); }
  .privacy-glow-right { bottom: -100px; right: -100px; background: var(--sage-400); }
  .privacy-shield { font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .privacy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .privacy-sub {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .privacy-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .privacy-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px 24px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    text-align: left;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .privacy-card:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .privacy-card .material-symbols-outlined {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .privacy-card h4 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .privacy-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 400px; }
  }
</style>
